{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S05这类18秒短段落里感受信息过密，且S11、S13有几处把原本不确定的心理说得过于确定，人物心理的连贯性不如X。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把重点词放大加亮，又把长叙述拆成短句，普通观众扫屏时更容易抓住每段的心理转折；感受词按音乐段落出现，也让情绪变化更具体、更有层次。X的完整叙述在因果解释和人物心理的前后连贯上更稳，尤其保留了许多「可能」「担心」「还拿不准」的微妙不确定性。总体而言，Y的即时观看体验更好，但X在叙事准确性和心理逻辑上更可靠。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc6735c8-59d6-4fbc-9361-bb8454628af2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205841948582Z", "elapsed_seconds": 78.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T21:00:00.767054+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "83e604bd7a4fd0f6f1c1c8fac8942321d78759f636562cfcb3c488b669b849d7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py":